        "header": "1Introduction",
        "images": [
            {
                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.38678/2610.38678v1/f1.png",
                "caption": "Figure 1:Evolution of interaction paradigms. AskStream extends the conventional action space ofwaitandanswerby introducingask, enabling models to proactively seek missing information from the video or user before answering.",
                "position": 297
            },
            {
                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.38678/2610.38678v1/f2_3.png",
                "caption": "Figure 2:Analysis of model uncertainty.(a) Across interaction turns, correct evidence consistently lowers normalized answer entropy, unlike mismatched evidence.\n(b) Relevant evidence shifts probability toward the correct answer.\n(c) Accuracy improves from 42.3% (blurred) to 62.3% after asking for key evidence, nearing 63.1% with fully clear input.",
                "position": 324
            }
        ]
