                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.38678/2610.38678v1/f4_1.png",
                "caption": "Figure 4:Statistics of AskStream.(a) Task taxonomy, data distribution, and sources.\n(b) Total effective durations ofwait,ask, andansweracross subtasks.\n(c) Video durations and sample counts across domains.\nThe benchmark averages 3.2 interaction turns per video and contains 2714 manually annotated timestamps in total.",
